lass=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 교육 목적 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 15.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1) 2011년에 실시 계획 중인 해외(중국)취업 연수사업을 위한 사전 어학 교육</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 15.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">성적 우수자를 선별하여, 2011년에 실시하는 해외(중국)취업 연수 참여 자격 부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">여</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 15.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’\">2. 세부내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수기간 : ’10. 12. 20(월) ~ 12. 30(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수대상 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 금오공과대학교 학부 졸업예정자(2011.8월 예정자 포함) 및 졸업생 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 모집인원 : 30명(선착순 모집) / 면접 일정 추후 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 접수방법 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 지원서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 보증금(10만원 - 수료 후 환불)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 인터넷 접수(</span><a href=\"http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> - 수강 신청)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 수강료 및 교재 : 무료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 강사진 : 원어민 강사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 기타문의 : http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr 게시판에 질문과 답변 활용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’\">3. 교육내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교육일정 : ‘11. 1. 3 ~ 1. 28</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 교육시간 : 13:00 ~ 18:00 1일 5시간 / 1개월(100H) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 교육내용 : 중국어 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">실무회화(직무 관련 용어) 및 생활 회화</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 교육장소 : 추후 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p cl